Division of labor\
Evelyn: auditor, work designer, red team, hands that copy/paste/run, final decisions. Collaborator: commands, drafts, analytics, its own memory of tokens.\
The collaborator keeps its own token analytics \'97 the owner is never the collaborator's record-keeper.\
