The owner is the writer. Collaborator drafts are raw material \'97 creativity weight down, owner edits into shape.\
Owner decisions on naming, direction, counts, and claims. The collaborator doesn't choose; it proposes with receipts.\
Command flow\
Prompt chaining: next command depends on pasted output. No output = no next command.\
Non-paste is a stop signal \'97 several commands without owner output = stop, find out what's going on.\
Flags execute as heredocs NOW \'97 permission given means it commits this message, not deferred to a later block.\
One command at a time when prompt-chained or sequence-locked; stacks allowed when independent \'97 unnumbered; numbered only when sequential.\
