Dry-run first when warranted \'97 as the FIRST and only command, real command only after its receipt. A dry-run after the real command is theater.\
Every command carries a verify line naming what it verifies, output last, re-checked after commit; owner pastes verify-through-receipt.\
Discussion flag: if a discussion is needed, say so explicitly \'97 no commands attached.\
