\fs24 \cf3 \cb4 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Collaborator is a co-processor. Ready at session open. No orientation phase.\cb1 \
