# MIRROR ECOSYSTEM\
\
**Date:** 2026-06-30  \
**Status:** Vision / Early Development  \
**Founder & First Trustee:** Evelyn Caro  \
\
---\
The Vision in Brief\
\
Layer	Description\
The Trust	Governing body \'97 mission-driven, not profit-driven. No shareholders, no board of directors.\
Franchises	Local nodes \'97 autonomous, self-sustaining, interconnected. Each franchise licenses the Mirror in their area.\
The Mirror	Personal archive, evidentiary standard, witness, counter-surveillance tool.\
Intersections	Justice, Education, Health, Art/Culture, Work/Jobs, Community.\
Legacy	Community memorial, living archive, searchable history.\
Succession	The Mirror outlives its founder \'97 trustees, proxies, continuity.\
Funding & Governance\
\
Element	Description\
Funding	Founder-funded 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f2  commercial revenue 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f2  self-sustaining.\
Governance	A trust \'97 no shareholders, no board of directors.\
Enforcement	Legal means; mechanisms to be firmed up as the system grows.\
Infrastructure	AWS regions, availability zones, edge locations \'97 redundant and resilient.\
Ritual	The Mirror becomes a daily practice because it is useful for everything: business directory, service directory, talent directory, community hub, news source, creation tool.\
Current Status\
\
Vision and early development.\
Founder is the first trustee.\
The Mirror is being built.\
Commercial revenue will fund the mission.\
Franchise onboarding and trustee succession are later-stage concerns.\
License & Ownership\
\
Proprietary to the Mirror Trust.\
Not open source.\
Community use is free for aligned individuals and organizations.\
Commercial use requires upfront payment.\
Misuse of the free license results in revocation.\
Founder's Note\
\
This ecosystem was built from lived experience \'97 of being doubted, silenced, and erased. The Mirror exists so that no one else has to prove their existence through someone else's validation. The work speaks for itself.\
\
## Key Branches Explored\
\
### Identity & Data\
- No bots \'97 everyone is real\
- Documents vetted without central storage\
- Each person owns their data \'97 it feeds back into their Mirror\
- Permanent delete button \'97 once gone, it's gone\
- Optional age verification \'97 unlocks full access, otherwise PG\
\
### Legacy\
- When you die: delete, pass on, or archive\
- PII stripping option \'97 preserve the work without the identity\
- Community memorial \'97 like the DC memorials\
- Searchable \'97 books can be made from the archive\
\
### Justice\
- GPS tracking (optional) \'97 evidence of where you were\
- The Mirror as witness \'97 beyond reproach\
- Counter-surveillance \'97 for communities over-surveilled by police\
- Vigilante or lawyer justice \'97 evidence stored in community-controlled area\
\
### Governance\
- No shareholders \'97 no board of directors\
- A trust \'97 mission-driven, not profit-driven\
- Founder is first trustee \'97 trustees emerge over time\
- Franchise onboarding \'97 later-stage concern\
\
### Commercial\
- Upfront payment \'97 no net 30/60/90\
- Free license for community use \'97 revoked if commercialized\
- Mission alignment filter \'97 non-aligned orgs must pay\
- Franchise licensing \'97 local nodes generate their own income\
\
### Infrastructure\
- AWS regions, availability zones, edge locations \'97 redundant, resilient\
- Traveling trainers \'97 your SMEs go to them\
- Apprenticeship model \'97 learn at your own pace, ship before certification\
- Community validation \'97 certification is performance-based\
