The thirty-minute mark	\'93a fingerprint\'94 of the failure	The watchdog\'92s staleness timeout \'97 nothing failed at thirty minutes; silence reached its limit\
The paper\'92s thesis is unchanged and reinforced: the cache process failed twenty times; the corpus of 127 conversations was intact at every preflight. The finding aid died and was rebuilt at will. The collection never noticed. The author\'92s pipeline, published as a free and open artifact, carries this war story in its README \'97 battle-tested, not beta-tested.\
\
